        {
          "question": "订单量也一起看",
          "expect": {"metrics": ["gmv", "order_cnt"], "dimensions": ["date"], "grain": "month", "time_start": "2018-01-01", "time_end": "2019-01-01"}
        }
      ],
      "note": "追加指标：维度/粒度/时间必须继承，指标是两个而不是只剩新指标。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "mt07",
      "follow_up_type": "dimension_add",
      "turns": [
        {
          "question": "2018 年 GMV 是多少？",
          "expect": {"metrics": ["gmv"], "dimensions": [], "time_start": "2018-01-01", "time_end": "2019-01-01"}
        },
        {
          "question": "按品类拆开看看",
          "expect": {"metrics": ["gmv"], "dimensions": ["product_category"], "time_start": "2018-01-01", "time_end": "2019-01-01"}
        }
      ],
      "note": "同 mt03，换成品类维度；验证维度继承不是硬编码州。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "mt08",
      "follow_up_type": "limit",
      "turns": [
        {
          "question": "2018 年各州 GMV 是多少？",
