      "note": "只换粒度：时间窗与指标沿用。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "mt10",
      "follow_up_type": "filter_add",
      "turns": [
        {
          "question": "2018 年 GMV 是多少？",
          "expect": {"metrics": ["gmv"], "dimensions": [], "time_start": "2018-01-01", "time_end": "2019-01-01"}
        },
        {
          "question": "去掉取消订单再算",
          "expect": {"metrics": ["gmv"], "dimensions": [], "filters": ["order_status <> 'canceled'"], "time_start": "2018-01-01", "time_end": "2019-01-01"}
        }
      ],
      "note": "追加状态筛选：时间窗继承；不得把 `order_status` 当作分组维度。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "mt11",
      "follow_up_type": "dimension_add",
      "turns": [
        {
          "question": "2018 年平均评分是多少？",
