      "note": "换指标族也要继承时间：评分题的时间语义必须与订单题一致。"
    },
    {
      "case_id": "mt12",
      "follow_up_type": "dimension_add",
      "turns": [
        {
          "question": "2018 年配送延迟率是多少？",
          "expect": {"metrics": ["delivery_late_rate"], "dimensions": [], "time_start": "2018-01-01", "time_end": "2019-01-01"}
